# Phase 3: Interactivity and Cart State Management

The structural layout and visual UI of the Nutrexia storefront are complete and deployed! Now, in Phase 3, we will breathe life into the static components by implementing real functional state management. 

## Proposed Changes

We will introduce a global Cart state, a real-time countdown timer for the FOMO drop, toast notifications for user feedback, and a functional mobile navigation menu.

---

### UI State and Context

#### [MODIFY] [UIContext.tsx](file:///d:/Shravan/nutrexia/nutrexia-website/src/context/UIContext.tsx)
- Enhance `UIContext` to include full Cart state management (`cartItems`, `addToCart`, `removeFromCart`, `updateQuantity`, `cartTotal`).
- Add state for Toast notifications (`toastMessage`, `showToast`).
- Add state for Mobile Menu (`isMobileMenuOpen`, `toggleMobileMenu`).

